{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21568","headline":"哀病骢呈致用 · 元稹","name":"哀病骢呈致用","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枥上病骢啼褭褭，江边废宅路迢迢。\n自经梅雨长垂耳，乍食菰蒋欲折腰。\n金络头衔光未灭，玉花衫色瘦来燋。\n曾听禁漏惊衙鼓，惯蹋康衢怕小桥。\n半夜雄嘶心不死，日高饥卧尾还摇。\n龙媒薄地天池远，何事牵牛在碧霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}